
"smart_sources:Flora - Memory Books/117 - Sensory Bond Denial.md": {"path":"Flora - Memory Books/117 - Sensory Bond Denial.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"4lpmsf","at":1777331817827},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777330766426,"size":3462,"at":1777331817893,"hash":"4lpmsf"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,45],"#117 - Sensory Bond Denial":[47,48],"#117 - Sensory Bond Denial#{1}":[48,48]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["The Sealed Hall","Ryan Adame","Queen Maya","Palace of Loth Logan","family introduction","power demonstration","projection discovery","emotional resonance","Althena","June 21 1843","velvet cords","sensory bond","Charlotte Claymore","Florence Claymore","Estra Hamilton","intimate scene","sympathetic arousal","orgasm","restraint","guidance","verbalization","touch exploration"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"**What:** Sensory bond experiment revealing a critical flaw—it transmits all sexual sensations except orgasm, leaving Charlotte stranded at the edge. Part of the Two Hours of Softness period.\n\n**When to use:** When Charlotte experiences the sensory bond or when characters reference its orgasm-denial limitation. Also relevant during sexually charged group scenes at the Palace.\n\n**Key relationships:** Charlotte, Ryan, Florence, and Estra—with Ryan discovering the bond's limitation and laughing at Charlotte's torment, Florence delightedly teasing her desperation, and Estra confused but present.","location":"Duran","scene_type":"intimacy","character_present":["Ryan","Charlotte","Florence","Estra"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/117 - Sensory Bond Denial.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"bdmysr","at":1777331817827},"key":"Flora - Memory Books/117 - Sensory Bond Denial.md#---fro